<title>PAKISTAN: ICI Pakistan Ltd rises 7.4 percent.</title>
<headline>ICI Pakistan Ltd rises 7.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Pakistan Ltd 10-rupee stock soared 2.25 rupees, or 7.40 percent, to 32.65 in early trade on Monday on strong buying interest, dealers at the Karachi Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Buying interest in ICI followed an announcement of a 50:50 joint venture between ICI Pakistan and Dupont in a PTA (pure terephthelic acid) plant under construction in Karachi, dealer Ali Raza Mooney said.</p>
<p>Some 14 million shares of ICI changed hands in early trade, he said.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.62 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
